0 Motor bench, no hub (Brickwright Robot Lab reference model)
0 Name: motor-bench.ldr
0 Author: Brickwright
0 !LDRAW_ORG Unofficial_Model
0 // A SPIKE medium motor standing on the floor with an 8-tooth gear on a vertical axle in its
0 // output. There is no hub: the Robot Lab's own lab-direct hub owns the motor, and the robotlab
0 // blocks, the lab words and Python/JS _robotlab calls turn it directly.
0 !BW ID motor
0 !BW PORT A
1 71 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 1 54696p01.dat
0 !BW ID axle
1 4 0 -90 0 0 1 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 3706.dat
0 !BW ID gear
1 72 0 -70 0 1 0 0 0 0 1 0 -1 0 3647.dat
